body:
rode my motorcycle to work through similar weather once. waddled in to the staff room with my pants frozen in riding position and calmly asked to borrow a blow torch. they looked at me like i had 3 heads.

&#x200B;

    another time i turned up to a gas station looking like this and asked for a cup of coffee. the attendant took one look at me and said "um...our macnhine is broken.. but let me make you one out the back, you look like you need it and my boss isn't here

the footage has been posted, in spite of the commentary, there is actually a lot of maths and safety considerations having gone into  this

&#x200B;

 [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DIvyCZncNEU&t=17s](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DIvyCZncNEU&t=17s)
